# Đề bài

Cho các tập hợp $A$, $B$ và $C$. Chứng minh rằng:

a) $A \cap (B \cup C) = (A \cap B) \cup (A \cap C)$.

b) $A \cup (B \cap C) = (A \cup B) \cap (A \cup C)$.

c) $A \cap (B \setminus C) = (A \cap B) \setminus C$.

# Lời giải

a) Ta có $\forall x \in A \cap (B \cup C) \Leftrightarrow \left\{
\begin{aligned}
& x \in A \\
& x \in B \cup C
\end{aligned}
\right. \Leftrightarrow \left\{
\begin{aligned}
& x \in A \\
& \hoac{& x \in B \\ & x \in C}
\end{aligned}
\right. \Leftrightarrow \hoac{\left\{\begin{aligned}&x\in A\\&x\in B\end{aligned}\right.\\\left\{\begin{aligned}&x\in A\\&x\in C\end{aligned}\right.} \Leftrightarrow x \in (A \cap B) \cup (A \cap C)$.

Suy ra $A \cap (B \cup C) = (A \cap B) \cup (A \cap C)$.

b) Ta có $\forall x \in A \cup (B \cap C) \Leftrightarrow \hoac{& x \in A \\ & x \in B \cap C} \Leftrightarrow \hoac{& x \in A \\ & \left\{\begin{aligned}&x\in B\\&x\in C\end{aligned}\right.} \Leftrightarrow \left\{\begin{aligned}&\hoac{&x\in A\\&x\in B}\\\&\hoac{&x\in A\\&x\in C}\end{aligned}\right. \Leftrightarrow x \in (A \cup B) \cap (A \cup C)$.

Suy ra $A \cup (B \cap C) = (A \cup B) \cap (A \cup C)$.

c) Ta có $\forall x \in A \cap (B \setminus C) \Leftrightarrow \left\{
\begin{aligned}
& x \in A \\
& x \in B \setminus C
\end{aligned}
\right. \Leftrightarrow \left\{
\begin{aligned}
& x \in A \\
& x \in B \\
& x \notin C
\end{aligned}
\right. \Leftrightarrow \left\{\begin{aligned}&x \in A \cap B\\&x \notin C\end{aligned}\right. \Leftrightarrow x \in (A \cap B) \setminus C$.

Suy ra $A \cap (B \setminus C) = (A \cap B) \setminus C$.

