A. $A \cup (B \cap C) = (A \cup B) \cap (A \cup C)$

B. $(A \cup B) \cap C = (A \cap B) \cup C$

C. $(A \setminus B) \cap C = (A \cap B) \setminus C$

D. $(A \cup B) \setminus C = (A \setminus B) \cap C$

